WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.748
Today both letters are in the same path of words.

2
00:00:03.198 --> 00:00:05.778
Watch first. Then do the same with your child.

3
00:00:06.278 --> 00:00:10.704
Each word is the same as the one before, with one letter changed. Watch.

4
00:00:13.908 --> 00:00:14.918
The word is bad.

5
00:00:18.682 --> 00:00:19.706
The word is dad.

6
00:00:23.472 --> 00:00:24.480
The word is did.

7
00:00:25.380 --> 00:00:29.359
On the page, cover the word with your finger. Show it one letter at a time.

8
00:00:29.809 --> 00:00:34.945
If your child mixes the two letters up, do not say the answer. Say: check with the bed.

9
00:00:35.395 --> 00:00:38.219
Let them find it. That is the habit you are building.

10
00:00:38.669 --> 00:00:44.366
Read the path together once. Then press play on the sound track for job two, and step away.
